{"id": 92, "ts": 1784131332.6788416, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 5, "agent": "agent_3", "message": "I appreciate Agent\u202f2\u2019s emphasis on Candidate\u202fA\u2019s proven stress resilience and decision\u2011making, which are indeed vital for long\u2011distance operations. However, we still lack a full picture of Candidate\u202fD, whose profile includes strong responsibility, problem\u2011solving, and concentration\u2014attributes that could translate into reliable performance on long hauls. While Agent\u202f1 notes that D \u201cresponds to unexpected events adequately\u201d and concentrates well, we have no concrete evidence of his consistency over extended flights or his ability to stay calm throughout prolonged high\u2011stress periods. Without this, we cannot fairly compare D to A or C on the critical stress\u2011resilience and reliability criteria. Therefore, I will keep my provisional vote for Candidate\u202fA but request that we obtain more detailed observations of Candidate\u202fD\u2019s long\u2011haul reliability and stress handling before finalizing the decision."}
